================================================================================
Third-Party Content
================================================================================

This distribution does not include third-party documentation, specification
prose, or vendored reference corpora. During development, gasm's citation
discipline (the `/- REF: ... -/` annotations required by docs/REVIEW.md)
was backed by a local `references/` directory containing copies of
third-party material (instruction-set manuals, format specifications, RFCs,
and similar). That material is not part of this distribution: citations
resolve against an external reference index (source URL and content hash)
rather than a vendored copy shipped in this repository, so no third-party
prose is redistributed here and no attribution obligation for it attaches
to this distribution.

No third-party source code, libraries, or package dependencies are
compiled into or distributed with gasm (see lake-manifest.json: zero
external packages).

If a future version of this project vendors or redistributes third-party
code, data, or documentation, the required attribution for that material
will be added here at that time.
